Z||000000||stimpy||06-28-2001||12:05 PM||||I'm gonna vent a pet peave. Why is it that some folks feel that they must post their sig EVERY FREAKIN TIME THEY POST? I mean come on, once per thread is quite sufficient. And why is it some will list every damn mod they have on their car? Is that Pep Boys gearshift that important of a mod that you need to list it for everyone to see fifteen times in a thread?<P>My other peeve is when people quote a post in entirety, even when it was the previous post. Is it too much trouble to edit down the quote to a salient detail that you are responding to?<P>||||reg||13
